{
  "_comment": "Cobble Instincts default template. It is copied to config/cobbleinstincts/behaviors.json the first time. If the 'version' of the user's file is lower than this template's, a backup (.bak) is made and the file is regenerated. Editable live with /cobbleinstincts reload. Species ids are showdownIds (lowercase, no dashes): 'oddish', 'alolansandshrew'. IMPORTANT: if a Pokemon matches two entries with the SAME id, only the first one applies, so the more specific entries go first. 'globals.configOpLevel' (1-4, default 2) is the operator permission level needed to change this config from the in-game menu or with /cobbleinstincts toggle; it can only be changed by editing this file, never from the menu. Since 0.6.3 (config v34), recent untested instincts with world-edit, item-economy, damage or combat risks are opt-in (enabled=false). Older instincts and benign new instincts keep their defaults. During upgrade, enabled=true matching the v33 default also becomes false; re-enable after upgrading if desired. Custom deltas are preserved, and custom compat files override bundled defaults.",
  "version": 56,
  "globals": {
    "debugLogging": false,
    "maxAttachAttempts": 40,
    "passiveTickInterval": 20,
    "activationIcon": true,
    "tcFlightOffInRain": true,
