    {
      "id": "fish_snatch",
      "enabled": true,
      "_comment": "Seals, sea lions and walruses try to snatch a raw fish straight out of your hand (main or off hand) when you hold one close, then waddle off and eat it. Only what you HOLD counts: nothing is taken from the rest of the inventory, and if you put the fish away before they reach you they give up. 'targets' lists what tempts them (categories, #tags or item ids; pufferfish is left out on purpose). Same options as steal_item otherwise; damage 0 = a harmless bump. Raw fish lying on the ground is also picked up and eaten. What it carries is dropped back when it is hurt, dies, is captured, starts a Pokemon battle or its chunk reloads; only the fish it eats is lost.",
      "species": [
        "seel",
        "dewgong",
        "spheal",
        "sealeo",
        "walrein",
        "popplio",
        "brionne",
        "primarina"
