      "_comment": "Dogs fetch a stick that a player throws with right click and bring it back. The click is only used when a fetcher is within 32 blocks. They start at minSpeed and accelerate over accelerationTicks to their cruise speed: speed scaled by speedMode (speed_stat = the Pokemon's Speed stat against speedStatRef, size = its width, fixed) and clamped to minSpeed-maxSpeed. While fetching they sprint, which shows the running pose (ground_run / ride_ground_run) on models that have one.",
      "species": [
        "growlithe",
        "arcanine",
        "lillipup",
        "herdier",
        "stoutland",
        "poochyena",
        "mightyena",
        "rockruff",
        "lycanroc",
        "yamper",
        "boltund",
        "fidough",
        "dachsbun",
        "houndour",
        "snubbull",
        "granbull",
        "furfrou"
      ],
